  "item_short_desc": "<p>Get ready to battle the elements with our CWU-45P Flight Jacket. Originally created for combat pilots, the CWU-45P jacket is a great way to keep warm and dry. The cold weather uniform jacket features a 100% nylon water-repellent outer shell that protects you from light rain and snow. The bi-swing back enhances your upper body&rsquo;s mobility while the poly fiberfill insulation keeps you warm, allowing you to focus on the task at hand.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "3688",
  "description": "<p>Get ready to battle the elements with our CWU-45P Flight Jacket. Originally created for combat pilots, the CWU-45P jacket is a great way to keep warm and dry. The cold weather uniform jacket features a 100% nylon water-repellent outer shell that protects you from light rain and snow. The bi-swing back enhances your upper body&rsquo;s mobility while the poly fiberfill insulation keeps you warm, allowing you to focus on the task at hand. Insulating Protection: These aviator jackets come equipped with a warm quilted lining with poly fiberfill that keeps the cold out while retaining internal body heat. The soft ribbed knit fabric cuffs and waistband provide additional insulation. Full Range of Motion: The military bomber jacket features a comfort fit design with an extra full cut for a perfect fit, and a bi-swing back that allows your arms to move more freely for various cold weather activities. Utility Pockets: Our ruggedly durable flight jackets offer convenient storage options through 2 fully lined hand pockets with hook &amp; loop closure flaps, and a zippered utility sleeve pocket on the left arm with exterior pen holders. Classic Styling: In addition to the hook &amp; loop field and color-matched badge on the left chest, the CWU-45P jacket also features a zippered front closure with a storm flap, brass zippers, and leather pull tabs.</p>",
